    "publishedAt": "2026-11-03",
    "summary": "With the booming development of next-generation graphics cards and AI applications, global power supply leading brand FSP Group announces the expansion of its highly popular 50ADA series, launching the new flagship 1200 W Gold non-modular power supply—FSP1200-50ADA. This power supply, built specifically for hardcore gamers and AI developers, effortlessly handles top-tier graphics cards like the RTX 5090 and RTX 6000 pro Blackwell, and can provide robust power for Edge AI Inference workstations. ATX 3.1 Standard and Gold Certification, Seamless Integration with Next-Gen Hardware Continuing the excellent architecture of the 50ADA series, FSP1200-50ADA fully complies with the latest Intel ATX 12 V V3.1 design guide, perfectly withstanding the transient power spikes of next-gen graphics cards. This model meets 80 Plus Gold efficiency, with conversion efficiency up to 90%, and adopts an eco-friendly design concept.",
